18:T5fc,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What can an AI agent actually do for my business?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"An AI agent can execute multi-step processes autonomously: qualify and respond to leads, triage support tickets, research and summarize information, keep systems in sync, or run internal workflows that currently need manual effort. Anything with clear inputs, tools, and success criteria is a candidate."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which frameworks do you use for AI agent development?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Primarily LangGraph and LangChain in Python with the OpenAI API (or Claude/Gemini where they fit better), orchestrated behind a FastAPI backend. For business-process automation I also combine agents with n8n workflows."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do you keep agents from hallucinating or misbehaving?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I built Sentinel AI, an LLM red-teaming framework, so safety is a first-class part of my process: constrained tool schemas, output validation, bounded loops, human-approval gates for sensitive actions, and evaluation suites that test the agent against adversarial inputs before launch."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you work with international clients?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes — I work remotely with clients in the USA, UK, Canada, Australia, Europe, UAE, and worldwide, with overlap-friendly communication and async updates."}}]}b:["$","div",null,{"className":"min-h-screen bg-cyber-black text-cyber-blue relative","children":[["$","$L15",null,{}],["$","$L16",null,{"entranceDelay":0}],["$","main",null,{"className":"relative z-10 pt-24 pb-8 min-h-screen","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"absolute inset-0 cyber-grid-bg opacity-10 pointer-events-none"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"container mx-auto px-4 relative z-10","children":[[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json