\",\"@id\":\"https://pavansharmaportfolio.in/#person\",\"name\":\"Pavan Sharma\"},\"areaServed\":[\"United States\",\"United Kingdom\",\"Canada\",\"Australia\",\"Europe\",\"United Arab Emirates\",\"Worldwide\"],\"availableChannel\":{\"@type\":\"ServiceChannel\",\"serviceUrl\":\"https://pavansharmaportfolio.in/contact/\"}}"}}],["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$18"}}],"$L19"]]}]]}],"$L1a"]}]
19:["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-4xl mx-auto","children":[["$","header",null,{"className":"text-center mb-14","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-code text-xs text-cyber-blue-dim tracking-widest uppercase mb-3","children":["// SERVICE MODULE: ","AI AGENT DEVELOPMENT"]}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"cyber-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl neon-text","children":["🤖"," ","AI Agent Development Services"]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"font-code text-cyber-blue-dim text-sm max-w-2xl mx-auto mt-5 leading-relaxed","children":"I design and build AI agents that go beyond chat — autonomous systems that plan multi-step work, call your tools and APIs, verify their own output, and complete real business tasks. I develop AI agents professionally at micro1 and build agentic workflows with LangGraph and n8n."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-7","children":["$","$L17",null,{"href":"/contact/","className":"cyber-button-pink inline-block px-8 py-3 text-sm","children":"⚡ Discuss Your Project"}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-10","children":[["$","section",null,{"className":"cyber-glass p-6","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-cyber text-base text-cyber-red uppercase tracking-wider mb-3","children":"⚠ The Problem"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"font-code text-sm text-cyber-blue-dim leading-relaxed","children":"Most businesses use AI as a fancy autocomplete. The real value appears when AI can execute processes end-to-end — researching, deciding, calling systems, and reporting back — without a human driving every step. Building that reliably is hard: naive agents loop forever, hallucinate tool inputs, and fail silently."}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"cyber-glass p-6","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-cyber text-base text-cyber-green uppercase tracking-wider mb-3","children":"✓ The Solution"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"font-code text-sm text-cyber-blue-dim leading-relaxed","children":"I build production-grade agents with explicit state machines (LangGraph), constrained tool schemas, retry and self-correction loops, and observability baked in. Every agent ships with guardrails: input validation, output checks, cost limits, and fallbacks — informed by my LLM red-teaming background (Sentinel AI)."}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-cyber text-lg text-cyber-blue uppercase tracking-wider mb-4","children":"// Technologies Used"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex flex-wrap gap-2","children":[["$","span","Python",{"className":"neon-badge text-xs","children":"Python"}],["$","span","LangGraph",{"className":"neon-badge text-xs","children":"LangGraph"}],["$","span","LangChain",{"className":"neon-badge text-xs","children":"LangChain"}],["$","span","OpenAI API",{"className":"neon-badge text-xs","children":"OpenAI API"}],["$","span","FastAPI",{"className":"neon-badge text-xs","children":"FastAPI"}],["$","span","n8n",{"className":"neon-badge text-xs","children":"n8n"}],["$","span","PostgreSQL",{"className":"neon-badge text-xs","children":"PostgreSQL"}],["$","span","Docker",{"className":"neon-badge text-xs","children":"Docker"}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"cyber-glass p-6 mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-cyber text-lg text-cyber-blue uppercase tracking-wider mb-4","children":"// What You Get"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"space-y-2","children":[["$","li","Agent architecture design (state graph, tools, memory)",{"className":"font-code text-sm text-cyber-blue-dim flex items-start gap-2","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-neon-pink mt-0.5","children":"▸"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Agent architecture design (state graph, tools, memory)"}]]}],["$","li","Custom tool/API integrations for your systems",{"className":"font-code text-sm text-cyber-blue-dim flex items-start gap-2","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-neon-pink mt-0.5","children":"▸"}],"$L1b"]}],"$L1c","$L1d","$L1e"]